# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate for the latest version of Qiskit noise learning"
msgstr "Poznaj model szumu bramki w najnowszej wersji Qiskit noise learning"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate"
msgstr "Poznaj model szumu bramki"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn the noise model of a gate {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"
msgstr "Poznaj model szumu bramki {#learn-the-noise-model-of-a-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates learning a noise model for a unitary gate with a standard learning protocol accessible through the high-level protocol functions [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") and [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Ten samouczek pokazuje, jak nauczyć się modelu szumu dla bramki unitarnej za pomocą standardowego protokołu uczenia dostępnego przez wysokopoziomowe funkcje protokołów [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") i [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the gate\n"
msgstr "Zdefiniuj bramkę\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up local simulation\n"
msgstr "Skonfiguruj lokalną symulację\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Przygotuj program kwantowy\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the quantum program\n"
msgstr "Uruchom program kwantowy\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the results\n"
msgstr "Odczytaj wyniki\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Running on real hardware\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The circuits below are simulated locally, so this walkthrough needs no IBM Quantum® credentials. To alternatively run it on a real device:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Uruchamianie na prawdziwym sprzęcie\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Poniższe obwody są symulowane lokalnie, więc to omówienie nie wymaga poświadczeń IBM Quantum®. Aby zamiast tego uruchomić je na prawdziwym urządzeniu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '  *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1**: replace [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") with a real backend.\n"
msgstr "**Krok 1**: zastąp [`FakeMarrakesh`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/fake-provider-fake-marrakesh \"(in Qiskit Runtime IBM Client)\") prawdziwym Backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  *   **Step 2**: pass that backend as the executor’s mode, and drop the simulator options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  *   **Krok 2**: przekaż ten Backend jako tryb executora i usuń opcje symulatora.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"define-the-gate\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Define the gate {#1-define-the-gate}"
msgstr "1. Zdefiniuj bramkę {#1-define-the-gate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gate is a [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) holding a twirled layer of six disjoint `CZ` gates.\n"
msgstr "Bramka to [`BoxOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.BoxOp) zawierający twirlowaną warstwę sześciu rozłącznych bramek `CZ`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Running on real hardware\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Uruchamianie na prawdziwym sprzęcie\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"set-up-local-simulation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Set up local simulation {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"
msgstr "2. Skonfiguruj lokalną symulację {#2-set-up-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pauli indices inside each map are local to the gate, in ascending physical-qubit order:\n"
msgstr "Indeksy Pauliego wewnątrz każdej mapy są lokalne względem bramki i uporządkowane rosnąco według fizycznych kubitów:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the noise with a correlated `ZZ` term and a weaker `XX` term on each `CZ` pair, plus a single-qubit `Z` term everywhere; measurement gets a bit-flip term per qubit.\n"
msgstr "Zdefiniuj szum ze skorelowanym członem `ZZ` i słabszym członem `XX` na każdej parze `CZ`, a także z jednokubitowym członem `Z` wszędzie; pomiar otrzymuje człon odwrócenia bitu dla każdego kubitu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a box for measurement to learn.\n"
msgstr "Zbuduj box dla pomiaru, aby go nauczyć.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each entry of `layer_noise_model` pairs one of those boxes with the map to apply to it. Use the stabilizer simulation method, and set `seed_simulator` to make the simulated data reproducible.\n"
msgstr "Każdy wpis `layer_noise_model` łączy w parę jeden z tych boxów z mapą, która ma być do niego zastosowana. Użyj metody symulacji stabilizatorowej i ustaw `seed_simulator`, aby symulowane dane były powtarzalne.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"prepare-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Prepare the quantum program {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "3. Przygotuj program kwantowy {#3-prepare-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\") to build the quantum program containing the learning experiments.\n"
msgstr "Użyj [`prepare_vanilla_program()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-prepare-vanilla-program#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.prepare_vanilla_program\"), aby zbudować program kwantowy zawierający eksperymenty uczące.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"run-the-quantum-program\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Run the quantum program {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"
msgstr "4. Uruchom program kwantowy {#4-run-the-quantum-program}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the quantum program. This step is the same whether the executor is pointed at a simulator or at a real device.\n"
msgstr "Prześlij program kwantowy. Ten krok jest taki sam niezależnie od tego, czy executor wskazuje na symulator, czy na prawdziwe urządzenie.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"read-the-results\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Read the results {#5-read-the-results}"
msgstr "5. Odczytaj wyniki {#5-read-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Process the result with [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"
msgstr "Przetwórz wynik za pomocą [`process_vanilla_result()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-noise-learning/generated/protocols-process-vanilla-result#qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result \"qiskit_noise_learning.protocols.process_vanilla_result\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot per-qubit-pair fidelity decays: both the data and the exponential fit.\n"
msgstr "Narysuj zaniki wierności dla każdej pary kubitów: zarówno dane, jak i dopasowanie wykładnicze.\n"
